WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.858
Today your child listens for one thing. Do two words start the same?

2
00:00:04.308 --> 00:00:06.888
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.388 --> 00:00:12.589
First, point to each picture on the page and say its name. Your child says it after you.

4
00:00:13.039 --> 00:00:15.264
Now listen to how these two words start.

5
00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:16.651
The word is sun.

6
00:00:18.235 --> 00:00:19.276
The word is sock.

7
00:00:20.859 --> 00:00:21.954
They start the same.

8
00:00:22.754 --> 00:00:23.710
Now these two.

9
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.097
The word is sun.

10
00:00:26.681 --> 00:00:27.696
The word is map.

11
00:00:29.473 --> 00:00:30.846
They do not start the same.

12
00:00:31.646 --> 00:00:36.948
When you say the words to your child, hold the start a little longer. Do not shout it. Stretch it.

13
00:00:37.398 --> 00:00:43.223
Your child circles the picture that starts like the first one. Do the four boxes of job one together.

14
00:00:43.673 --> 00:00:49.260
Job two is the same with three to choose from. Your child says the names out loud, alone.

15
00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:55.355
The answers are printed upside down in the corner. Your child turns the page around and checks.

16
00:00:55.805 --> 00:01:00.523
At the end, your child says three names for you, stretching the start. Mark each one.
